1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,780
These old hands can't haul the load they hauled back then

2
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:04,900
So I picked up a pen, and I went to war again

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:08,340
My body's got a fence line, but my mind's got none

4
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:11,540
It's still out on the back roads chasing down the sun

5
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:14,580
Lot of folks see odds like that and fold before the turn

6
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:17,620
But I've seen what one match can do with enough room to burn

7
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:20,820
I quit fighting the weather, quit cussing the rain
